s a query language based on the Ph.D. Thesis of Crist-Jan Doedens (see the relations field).<br>An implementation of MQL is needed to access the data in this data set. EMDROS is such an implementation and can be downloaded from http:\/\/emdros.org\/. It is created by Ulrik Sandborg-Petersen.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Linguistic Markup for Hebrew Bible, expressed in database format"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Hebrew (modern)"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-12-31"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"C. Sikkel"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"R. Oosting"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"O. Glanz"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J.W. Dyk"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-02-09"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-01-23"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Biblia Hebraica Stuttgardensis is the surface text.\nLinguistic features have been added to the text, they comprise the morpheme level, through syntax level up to discourse level.\nAll the analytical features added to the database are the work of the WIVU team."]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","mult